Open Cybersecurity Schema Framework (OCSF)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/ocsf/ocsfClassesData.ts is a derivative work of the OCSF schema, release
1.9.0:

    https://github.com/ocsf/ocsf-schema

It holds the names of the event classes, categories, objects and attributes
of the schema, and their requirements, in a different form. The descriptions
are left out. scripts/generate-ocsf-classes.js made the file from the schema;
the header of the file gives the rules. The schema is not vendored or fetched
by this repository.

The NOTICE of the schema reads:

